{"id":"n62453-1-12","stage":2,"title":"까닭 · 缘由","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62453-1-12-1","ko":"너는 승규가 왜 화를 냈는지 아니?","zh":"你知道承奎为什么生气吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"승규가","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"화를","meaning":"火，气","explanation":"화：火，气；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"화","audio":"/audio/950afe85bf406364ecdd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74134","senseId":"1","lemma":"화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"냈는지","meaning":"发脾气、表现出不满（화을/를 내다）","explanation":"내다：发脾气、表现出不满（화을/를 내다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"내다","audio":"/audio/3c7ab23f77767092623c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89906","senseId":"13","lemma":"내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아니?","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"950afe85bf406364","term":"화","zh":"火，气","audio":"/audio/950afe85bf406364ecdd.mp3","entryId":"74134","definition":"十分不满意或恼怒的情绪。","pronunciation":["화ː"]},{"id":"3c7ab23f77767092","term":"내다","zh":"发脾气、表现出不满（화을/를 내다）","audio":"/audio/3c7ab23f77767092623c.mp3","entryId":"89906","definition":"发脾气、表现出不满（화을/를 내다）","pronunciation":["내ː다"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"通过教育、经验、思考等来，具备与事物或情况相关的信息或知识。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d84d02572265f79fa9e3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62453-1-12-2","ko":"아니. 나도 도무지 그 까닭을 모르겠어.","zh":"不知道。我完全也想不明白原因。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니.","meaning":"不是，不用，不要","explanation":"아니：不是，不用，不要","readings":[{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65982","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도무지","meaning":"根本，完全","explanation":"도무지：根本，完全","readings":[{"term":"도무지","audio":"/audio/425284f47c3c524b4b48.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47105","senseId":"1","lemma":"도무지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그","meaning":"那样，那个","explanation":"그：那样，那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62250","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"까닭을","meaning":"缘由，缘故","explanation":"까닭：缘由，缘故；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"까닭","audio":"/audio/bfc35daeb7ae2f611843.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62453","senseId":"1","lemma":"까닭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모르겠어.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bcf26f704fdac00f","term":"아니","zh":"不是，不用，不要","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3","entryId":"65982","definition":"用于否定回答晚辈或年龄、地位等相等的人所提出的问题。","pronunciation":["아니"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"425284f47c3c524b","term":"도무지","zh":"根本，完全","audio":"/audio/425284f47c3c524b4b48.mp3","entryId":"47105","definition":"怎么也。","pronunciation":["도무지"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那样，那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"62250","definition":"指代前面已经讲过或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"bfc35daeb7ae2f61","term":"까닭","zh":"缘由，缘故","audio":"/audio/bfc35daeb7ae2f611843.mp3","entryId":"62453","definition":"发生某件事或做某事的理由或内情。","pronunciation":["까닥"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/901367fad9a7d63637eb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.315,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62453","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":77,"sequenceScore":2.1417,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不知道。我完全也想不明白原因。","今天是什么日子啊？真漂亮呢。","你知道承奎为什么生气吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["不知道。我完全也想不明白原因。","你知道承奎为什么生气吗？","今天是什么日子啊？真漂亮呢。"],"answer":0}]}
